Runnable software is accepted by running it; a diff, unit tests or a static screenshot never prove a user feature. Boot from the real scripts (never a
stale server) and fill every field below from real use; faked responses never
replace a load-bearing backend. For user-facing UI (user, 2026-10-17) use the app as its user and record a journey file (`website-experience.md` §2.7).
